\title{contentiousR: Tools and Data for Contentious Politics and Civil Conflict Research}
\description{
contentiousR creates COW- or Gleditsch-Ward-coded state-year panels and
joins bundled socioeconomic, conflict, protest, and leader data. V-Dem data
are available through the optional \code{vdemdata} package.
}
\details{
The main workflow starts with \code{\link[=build_states_panel]{build_states_panel()}} and continues with the
\verb{add_*()} functions. The corresponding \verb{load_*()} functions return source
data without joining it to a state panel.
}
\section{Country-code conversions}{

Conversions use \code{\link[countrycode:countrycode]{countrycode::countrycode()}}. Rows with no equivalent in the
requested coding system are omitted. Historical entities can differ between
COW and Gleditsch-Ward; users should inspect coverage for their study period.
}

